{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Publish fatal MDC restoration failures to the invocation caller.** If `restore.close()` throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` on an asynchronous executor, this `finally` still completes `result` with the selected success or pending outcome; only the worker observes the fatal. Complete `result` exceptionally with the cleanup fatal before rethrowing it, and publish the selected outcome only when restoration succeeds.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77SFCF","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":283,"observation_digest":"93577bef6a0d276d2a238d46522d52c8b959d3fb15e12f6cbedc0fbfe0cd6f9c","observation_id":"aro_v1_snlxx33kbutw2krdrvdfelkszc","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_oku3igfk3ygjtbpxj7vr4crtuk","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2df3d686638d1451d0c62cd2678c16968f3482f4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":280,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_j2qhkay74wn3ydg3wgltkx7edd","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
